    "m_ObjectId": "e99e7a87eca14890ae54de298b82cc03",
    "m_Title": "Feathering",
    "m_Content": "To create a soft transition fade in around the edges of the plane, the density of the clouds are feathered in from the edges of the UV. To control the amount of feather change `UVFeather`.\nNote: Because of this the plane mesh should have a UV which covers the entire UV space",
